{"seq":1,"slug":"life-and-times","title":"丹尼尔·卡尼曼·生平与时代","stage":"DONE","category":"daniel-kahneman","categoryLabel":"丹尼尔·卡尼曼","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/daniel-kahneman/life-and-times","rating":{"composite":3.69,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/07_daniel-kahneman/1_life-and-times","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"生平与时代\">生平与时代</h1><p>本卷讲述丹尼尔·卡尼曼（1934—2024）的人生历程。他是二十世纪最具影响力的心理学家之一、行为经济学的奠基人、2002年诺贝尔经济学奖得主。卡尼曼的童年是在第二次世界大战的烽火与纳粹迫害的阴影下度过的，这段经历使他对人性有了深刻的早期观察。战后，他走上学习心理学的道路，并与阿莫斯·特沃斯基结成了学术史上最传奇的合作，共同开创了启发法与偏误、前景理论等研究。</p>\n<p>本卷分为三章。第一章&quot;早年与求学&quot;,追溯他战乱中的童年与心理学的求学；第二章&quot;与特沃斯基的合作&quot;,讲述这段以&quot;有成效的分歧&quot;为引擎的传奇合作；第三章&quot;诺奖与晚年&quot;,描绘他荣获诺贝尔奖、出版《思考，快与慢》以及辉煌的人生终章。透过卡尼曼的生平，读者将看到一位心理学家如何深刻地改变了人类对自身判断与决策的认识。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本卷的定位-与兄弟卷的分工\">本卷的定位（与兄弟卷的分工）</h2><p>本卷只回答&quot;卡尼曼是谁、他的人生如何展开&quot;——即<strong>生平脉络与时代背景</strong>，提供动机、气质与时间线，但<strong>不展开他的理论本身</strong>。理论的实质内容由其他卷承担，请按需跳转：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>想知道<strong>他提出了什么</strong>（启发法与偏误、前景理论、双系统）→ 兄弟卷 <a href=\"../core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a></li>\n<li>想理解<strong>他的思想与研究方法</strong>（会犯错的心智、体验自我 vs 记忆自我）→ 兄弟卷 <a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a></li>\n<li>想了解<strong>他的代表著作</strong>（《思考，快与慢》《噪声》） → 兄弟卷 <a href=\"../major-works/\">主要著作</a></li>\n<li>想看<strong>他对各领域的影响与遗产</strong> → 兄弟卷 <a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与遗产</a></li>\n<li>想了解<strong>对他的批评与复制危机争议</strong> → 兄弟卷 <a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><p>本卷无前置要求，是了解卡尼曼最自然的入口。建议顺序：先读本卷建立人物与时间线 → 再读 <a href=\"../core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a> 掌握理论 → 然后 <a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a> 深化方法论 → 最后 <a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与遗产</a> 把他放回学科史中。本卷内部按时间顺序阅读即可：<a href=\"early-life/childhood-in-wartime\">战乱中的童年</a> → <a href=\"early-life/psychology-education\">心理学的求学</a> → <a href=\"partnership-with-tversky/the-meeting\">相遇与合作</a> → <a href=\"partnership-with-tversky/a-legendary-collaboration\">传奇的合作</a> → <a href=\"nobel-and-later/the-nobel-prize\">诺贝尔奖</a> → <a href=\"nobel-and-later/final-years\">晚年与辞世</a>。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"early-life","title":"早年与求学","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/daniel-kahneman/life-and-times/early-life","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"childhood-in-wartime","title":"战乱中的童年","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/daniel-kahneman/life-and-times/early-life/childhood-in-wartime"},{"seq":2,"slug":"psychology-education","title":"心理学的求学","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/daniel-kahneman/life-and-times/early-life/psychology-education"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"partnership-with-tversky","title":"与特沃斯基的合作","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/daniel-kahneman/life-and-times/partnership-with-tversky","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-meeting","title":"相遇与合作","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/daniel-kahneman/life-and-times/partnership-with-tversky/the-meeting"},{"seq":2,"slug":"a-legendary-collaboration","title":"传奇的合作","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/daniel-kahneman/life-and-times/partnership-with-tversky/a-legendary-collaboration"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"nobel-and-later","title":"诺奖与晚年","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/daniel-kahneman/life-and-times/nobel-and-later","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-nobel-prize","title":"诺贝尔奖","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/daniel-kahneman/life-and-times/nobel-and-later/the-nobel-prize"},{"seq":2,"slug":"final-years","title":"晚年与辞世","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/daniel-kahneman/life-and-times/nobel-and-later/final-years"}]}]}